#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file signatureconfigurationdialog.ui line 328
#: rc.cpp:948
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"<h1>Multipart detached signature</h1>\n"
"When this option is selected, the signature and the signed data will be "
"separate parts of a Multipart/Signed message part. Signed message data will "
"be readable even by Mail User Agents not supporting the signaturing "
"algorithm and not supporting ASN.1 decoding.\n"
"</qt>"
